     *=========================================================================
     *  VALID - Subroutine to attach this form to the policy
     *=========================================================================
     C     valid         begsr
     *
     C     rsky          chain     prs01                              60
     *
     C                   if        *in60 = *off
     C                             and rsjrst = enst
      *
     C     elasp1        ifeq      *zero
      *
     C     epky          setll     pep01
     C     epky          reade     pep01                                  60
      *
     C     *in60         doweq     *off
      *
     C     epstat        ifne      'I'
      *
     C     prky          setgt     ppr01
     C     prky1         readpe    ppr01                                  60
      *
     C     *in60         ifeq      *off
     C     prccfl        andeq     'Y'
     *
     *
